  "notes": [
    "Catalog aligned with cpq-patterns.md quote-creation flows.",
    "For programmatic quote creation: after DML or renewQuote(), call new zqu.Quote(quoteId).buildAndSave() in a Queueable — never in batch execute().",
    "For quote preview/metrics after creation, use zqu.MetricsUtil.getPreviewedInvoiceItems(Id) — not previewQuote(Id).",
    "previewQuote() accepts zqu__Quote__c, not Id.",
    "QPlanReader, QPlanWriter, QPlan, QCharge, QTier and CommitmentApi signatures come from the global declarations in the zqu package source. They work in legacy CPQ and in CPQ X.",
    "QPlan has no global add(): new plans come from the catalog, not from a QPlan method. Use remove() to drop a plan.",
    "The linter checks calls on the static classes only (QPlanReader, QPlanWriter, CommitmentApi, MetricsUtil, QuoteRecalculateController, zQuoteUtil). QPlan, QCharge and QTier are instance classes: they are signature authority for design and build, not linted."
  ],
